sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Wealth user
    participant F as Goal edit form<br/>(React Hook Form + Zod)
    participant R as Router goals.py
    participant G as GoalService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL (goals)

    U->>F: edit current_funded_amount
    F->>F: client validation (Zod): positive numbers,<br/>funded <= target, future date if changed
    F->>R: PATCH /api/v1/goals/G00007 {current_funded_amount}
    R->>R: GoalUpdate schema: extra fields forbidden, explicit null rejected,<br/>at least one field, amounts <= 14 digits / 2 dp, path ^G\d{5,}$
    alt invalid body
        R-->>F: 422 VALIDATION_ERROR details[{field, message}]
    end
    R->>G: update(goal_id, payload, user.id)
    G->>DB: BEGIN, then SELECT ... FROM goals WHERE goal_id = :id FOR UPDATE
    alt not found
        G-->>F: 404 GOAL_NOT_FOUND
    end
    G->>G: merge changes over stored row:<br/>funded <= target (cross-field, on merged state),<br/>target_date > today only if target_date changed
    alt rule violated
        G->>DB: no commit: request session closes -> ROLLBACK, lock released
        G-->>F: 422 VALIDATION_ERROR (field-level)
    end
    G->>DB: UPDATE goals SET <changed fields> WHERE goal_id = :id
    G->>DB: COMMIT (CHECK constraints are the last line of defence)
    G->>G: log goal_updated {goal_id, fields, by=user_id, request_id}
    G-->>F: 200 GoalOut {funded_pct, remaining_amount, flags[]}
    F->>F: invalidate ["goals", customer] query -> list re-fetches